            </p>
            <a href="/" class={`mt-10 tablet:w-64 w-full 2xl:w-80 text-lg 2xl:text-2xl 2xl: 2xl:py-3 font-thin rounded-full py-2 font-avenirBold border-2 transition duration-300 text-center text-t-off-black bg-t-green border-t-green md:text-t-off-black md:bg-green hover:bg-t-green hover:text-t-off-black`}>Meet Partner</a>
        </div>

        <div class="w-[50%] mx-auto pb-[15vh] flex flex-col justify-end" >
            <p class="font-avenirBold text-t-off-black uppercase text-center text-lg mb-3 flex flex-col justify-center items-center" >As seen in:</p>
